| S99 | 1044-1046 | `In the SH-4 programming manual (`_scratchpad/sh4_programming.txt`), the `FPSCR.PR` / `FPSCR.SZ` footnote (`:5148`) states: *"In the FADD, FSUB, FMUL, FDIV, FSQRT, FCMP/EQ, FCMP/GT, FLOAT, FTRC, FCNVDS, and FCNVSD instructions, `(PR, SZ) = (1, 1)` is reserved. For the FCNVDS and FCNVSD instructions, `(PR, SZ) = (0, 0)` and `(0, 1)` are also reserved."*` | [_scratchpad/sh4_programming.txt:5144-5149](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/_scratchpad/sh4_programming.txt#L5144-L5149) matches the quoted footnote verbatim. |
